==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|grc|en}} {{term|οὐρητήρ|lang=grc}}.

===Pronunciation=== 
* {{IPA|/jʊəˈriːtəɹ/|lang=en}} 

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|anatomy|lang=en}} Either of the two long, narrow [[duct]]s that carry [[urine]] from the [[kidney]]s to the [[urinary bladder]].

====Derived terms====
* [[ureteral]]
* [[ureteric]]

